  "title": "Behind the Scenes of Grimes’ MV “Miku-Maxxing”: Presented by sabukaru and GATA",
  "summary": "Grimes and Hatsune Miku’s new song “Miku-Maxxing” BTS with sabukaru and GATA",
  "content": "<p>Airy synths that take the shape of clouds and vocals that soar along electropop melodies, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/grimes/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Grimes </span></a>crafted that ethereal sound you hear in music everywhere nowadays with her own hands. A nod to the internet culture she inspired, she teamed up with <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cfm_miku_official/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Hatsune Miku</span></a> and Japanese Vocaloid producer <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/satapanpi/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>SatapanP </span></a>for her latest single “Miku-Maxxing.”</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          \n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>Grimes’ <em>Visions </em>(2012)<em> </em>and <em>Art Angels </em>(2015) impact cannot be stated enough. Whether it’s her do-it-yourself attitude by producing her own tracks or the electronic textures that she pushed from their homes of ambient and industrial music into a poppier space, Grimes did what felt right to her. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          \n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>Instead of just taking her own spin on what was hot at the time, Grimes&#x27; recontextualization and swirl of inspirations that are authentic to her made her music so fresh. It’s influences like the band <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/officialskinnypuppy/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Skinny Puppy</span></a>, an electro-industrial band from her hometown of Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada, that are a marquee example of her unique perspective.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650307189-0CPRYHBCV9LGEYP06C5Q/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_33+website.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"GRIMES_3 DIGITAL_33 website.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650307189-0CPRYHBCV9LGEYP06C5Q/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_33+website.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650315359-959V6K3ZYVEJSKHHS1EE/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_87.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"GRIMES_3 DIGITAL_87.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650315359-959V6K3ZYVEJSKHHS1EE/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_87.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650318803-N7CHWB7KJ3YG5G0UE6GC/grimes_084.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"grimes_084.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650318803-N7CHWB7KJ3YG5G0UE6GC/grimes_084.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n              \n                \n                <a href=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650289472-AJWYPQE3Y4AEFPG1QSMD/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_26+website.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                    <span>View fullsize</span>\n                  \n                  <img alt=\"GRIMES_3 DIGITAL_26 website.jpg\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/1787650289472-AJWYPQE3Y4AEFPG1QSMD/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_26+website.jpg?format=1000w\"><br>\n                </a>\n                \n              \n            \n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n    \n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n  <p>Fellow internet girl, the beloved blue-haired icon, Hatsune Miku, set the standard for vocaloid culture today. Created by Crypton Future Media in 2007, Hatsune Miku is a voicebank that can be used to make music. Her popularity arose in the online of <a href=\"https://www.nicovideo.jp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>niconicovideo </span></a>[ニコニコ動画] where independent users would upload videos using her software to make music. Since then, she’s spread all across mainstream media in Japan as well as abroad with vocaloid music legends like wowaka citing Miku as their inspiration to start making music.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          \n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>Presented by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sabukaru.online/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>sabukaru </span></a>and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/gata_magazine/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>GATA</span></a>, we got an inside look at the filming of the music video, produced by our creative agency <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bianco_bianco_tokyo/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Bianco Bianco</span></a>, that pairs two legends of internet culture. Radiating kindness and courteousness, Grimes worked through a long shoot with ease. That led to such a beautiful, finished video: glitching through the Miku-matrix; regal halls with Hatsune Miku’s signature blue; and poses that jump through the screen.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/57825361440243db4a4b7830/572ead9e-b56b-4245-b2ca-336b4d7d17df/GRIMES_3+DIGITAL_1365+gimp.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"5504\" height=\"8256\">\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p>Talking with sabukaru and GATA on set, Grimes spoke about her appreciation for Japan and the dedication of Japanese teams. We also captured the production in motion, meeting the crew such as the music video Director <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/eternalusa/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Valley</span></a> and the Director of Photography <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/a.yutaka/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Yutaka</span></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n          \n          \n            \n        \n        \n          \n        \n        \n            \n          \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>Check out the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v3rewELybuw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">music video</a>, now live on YouTube.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sabukaru.online/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    FOLLOW SABUKARU ON INSTAGRAM\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>With cooperation by Crypton Future Media, INC. © CFM  | DWANGO Co., Ltd./Nebula17</p><p>Photography by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/clubscarrr/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nathalie Scarlette</a></p><p>BTS Video by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sonja_annaa/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sonja Schmid</a></p><p>Editor <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/runedhalo/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Josh Moore</a></p><p><br>Music Video Credits:</p><p>Directed by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/eternalusa/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Valley Oh</a></p><p>Director of Photography: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/a.yutaka/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yutaka Akiyama</a></p><p>Production by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bianco_bianco_tokyo/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bianco Bianco</a></p><p>Executive Producer <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martaespinosa__/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Marta Espinosa</a></p><p>Post-Production by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mirai_international/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mirai</a></p><p>Creative Direction by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/zoo_as_zoo/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Zoo</a></p>",
